g\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/e3a3d119bf7703874c2acfb126a54df3.poster.avif?t=1752840799\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/e3a3d119bf7703874c2acfb126a54df3.mp4?t=1752840799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/222dc33b51297147f93ffe446ebf9fde.poster.avif?t=1752840799\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/222dc33b51297147f93ffe446ebf9fde.webm?t=1752840799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/222dc33b51297147f93ffe446ebf9fde.mp4?t=1752840799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a unique worldview centered around &quot;luck,&quot; this contemporary urban fantasy diverges from the norm. Across various sectors\u2014work, sports, healthcare, cuisine, and gaming\u2014nine romantic interests from different social strata await. Each character embodies both good and evil, resistance and struggle, with their own intricate backstories. Choose your life partner and join hands with them to uncover the hidden secrets of River Town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 9 dateable NPCs, and we will be releasing the 10th NPC in the future. Stay tuned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploring New River City to become the ultimate winner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/70faeb597e01bf13a6c2ad2827528d31.poster.avif?t=1752840799\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/70faeb597e01bf13a6c2ad2827528d31.webm?t=1752840799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315330/extras/70faeb597e01bf13a6c2ad2827528d31.mp4?t=1752840799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely through the bustling streets and hidden alleys, relying on your luck to scavenge for treasures; even a beggar can survive in River City.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer not to depend on luck or the lottery, you can choose to work hard and earn a living, taking steady steps to accumulate wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the turbulent currents of River City, a miraculous ascent from the bottom to the top awaits your realization.</p>",
